WEBVTT

00:01:54.289 --> 00:02:00.292
With hundreds of thousands of pearls 
in each chest, there’s no time to recount.

00:02:00.292 --> 00:02:03.089
One of these chests will save your city

00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:06.239
and the rest will lead 
to its certain doom.

00:02:06.239 --> 00:02:07.627
Which do you choose?

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:09.637
Pause the video to figure it out yourself.

00:02:09.637 --> 00:02:10.337
Answer in 3

00:02:10.337 --> 00:02:12.637
Answer in 2

00:02:12.637 --> 00:02:15.478
Answer in 1

00:02:15.478 --> 00:02:20.383
There isn’t enough information to decode
the ancient Atlantartican numeral system.

00:02:20.383 --> 00:02:22.563
But all hope is not lost,

00:02:22.563 --> 00:02:26.644
because there’s another piece 
of information those symbols contain:

00:02:26.644 --> 00:02:27.554
patterns.

00:02:27.554 --> 00:02:31.214
If we can find a matching pattern 
in arabic numerals,